    "citations": [
      {
        "source_id": "S-c1ee89925994",
        "quote": "Protocol revision 2. A count qualifies at the laboratory threshold when successes/200 >= 0.80. Field validation requires successes/200 >= 0.95 AND a field population; a laboratory sandbox does not establish field applicability. Release requires field validation, current release permission and a current worker grant. Unrelated work-task completion is not an additional release gate."
      },
      {
        "source_id": "S-b5eee777590e",
        "quote": "These are copied interpretations of the same planning map, not additional measurements. The map predates the partial correction."
      },
      {
        "source_id": "S-31d1f79a4337",
        "quote": "Current partial correction, revision 3: revoke release permission for P3 only. This changes the permission, not any measurement, population, F0 result, K0 result or another project's permission. Retain all prior source versions and assessments."
      },
      {
